## Low severity

### 3.1 Firebase anonymous auth and token bridge — Open
- **Problem:** left over from the Cloud Functions era. The app is now fully on-device, yet anonymous sign-in still runs
  on every iOS launch (`iOSApp.swift`, `AuthTokenProvider.kt`, `AuthTokenFetcherTests.swift`).
- **Fix:** remove sign-in, the provider classes and their tests.
- **Regression risk (5–10%):** confirm no other Firebase service (Crashlytics user mapping, Analytics, Remote Config
  or any Firestore rules) expects an authenticated UID.

### 3.2 Unused Ktor `HttpClient` — ✅ Done
Deleted the `single { HttpClient … }` block. A follow-up (`5fded6b6`) removed the orphaned Ktor build dependencies and
catalog entries (release APK ~108 KB smaller). `-dontwarn io.ktor.**` is kept on purpose.

### 3.3 Dead `NetworkErrorMapper` — ✅ Done
Deleted with its test.

### 3.4 Deprecated `UploadWidget` — ✅ Done
Deleted with its test, along with three orphaned `AppStrings` constants. Docs now point to `ImportPayslipDialog`.

### 3.5 Orphaned prototypes — Open
`pcdao_ai_prototype.html` and `web-prototype/` are outside the Gradle/Xcode graphs. Remove or archive to a branch.
Note that CLAUDE.md still lists `web-prototype/` as a supported sub-project, so update that if it goes.

